{"voice":"IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD","model":"eleven_v3","chunks":[{"audio":"/audio-chapters/1.3-1.mp3","steps":[{"key":"intro","text":"Chapter 1.3: Origin Story and Founders. Let's read it together, and I'll explain each part as we go.","words":[[0.268,0.408],[0.488,1.448],[1.585,2.408],[2.488,2.888],[2.948,3.128],[3.195,4.408],[4.548,5.048],[5.064,5.128],[5.155,5.208],[5.252,6.008],[6.048,6.168],[6.208,6.328],[6.388,6.808],[6.856,7.048],[7.112,7.368],[7.421,7.528],[7.581,7.688],[7.795,8.448]]},{"key":"story#0","text":"A family snack problem","words":[[9.438,9.448],[9.517,9.928],[10.008,10.408],[10.468,10.888]]},{"key":"story#1","text":"Founder Mridula Kanoria says she started the kitchen because she was tired of choosing between tasty and healthy for her own family. She asked why laddoos could not have protein, and why bhujia could not be roasted yet still delicious. In her family everyone worked, travelled and kept odd hours, so snacks were always in demand.","words":[[12.103,13.048],[13.128,13.528],[13.588,14.168],[14.216,14.408],[14.448,14.568],[14.618,14.968],[14.988,15.048],[15.098,15.448],[15.488,15.768],[15.808,15.928],[15.988,16.168],[16.235,16.568],[16.621,16.728],[16.772,17.128],[17.168,17.448],[17.541,18.008],[18.128,18.488],[18.548,18.968],[19.048,19.288],[19.328,19.448],[19.488,19.608],[19.677,20.728],[20.888,21.368],[21.408,21.608],[21.648,21.768],[21.848,22.248],[22.275,22.408],[22.448,22.568],[22.6,22.728],[22.808,23.448],[23.528,23.768],[23.828,24.008],[24.061,24.488],[24.515,24.648],[24.688,24.808],[24.861,24.968],[25.028,25.448],[25.528,25.768],[25.835,26.168],[26.232,27.128],[27.448,28.088],[28.128,28.248],[28.339,28.888],[28.932,29.288],[29.345,30.008],[30.056,30.488],[30.568,30.808],[30.856,31.048],[31.128,31.368],[31.435,32.168],[32.221,32.328],[32.397,32.808],[32.856,33.048],[33.117,33.528],[33.581,33.688],[33.757,34.248]]},{"key":"story#2","text":"Many strong businesses start with a problem the founder faces personally.","words":[[34.728,35.688],[35.745,36.088],[36.139,36.648],[36.701,36.968],[37,37.128],[37.168,37.208],[37.268,37.688],[37.708,37.768],[37.828,38.248],[38.315,38.648],[38.699,39.288]]},{"key":"story#3","text":"Small experiments in a home kitchen","words":[[39.688,40.488],[40.548,41.208],[41.261,41.368],[41.428,41.488],[41.512,41.608],[41.668,42.088]]},{"key":"story#4","text":"The brand began with small experiments using dates, millets and real masalas . The first aim was simple: make familiar snacks with cleaner ingredients, and check whether people still loved them.","words":[[42.688,43.528],[43.581,43.848],[43.928,44.328],[44.36,44.488],[44.555,44.888],[44.941,45.528],[45.595,45.928],[45.995,46.568],[46.608,47.048],[47.128,47.368],[47.432,47.688],[47.728,48.568],[48.928,49.288],[49.308,49.368],[49.421,49.688],[49.748,49.928],[49.968,50.088],[50.134,51.128],[51.176,51.368],[51.439,52.008],[52.077,52.488],[52.52,52.648],[52.698,53.048],[53.108,54.088],[54.148,54.328],[54.381,54.648],[54.688,54.968],[55.014,55.288],[55.341,55.608],[55.648,55.848],[55.88,56.168]]},{"key":"story#5","text":"A bigger problem than they first thought","words":[[56.888,57.448],[57.494,57.768],[57.818,58.168],[58.2,58.328],[58.36,58.488],[58.541,58.808],[58.858,59.208]]},{"key":"story#6","text":"Over the years, the founders realised they were solving a much bigger problem. People across India wanted delicious, healthy snacks they could trust. This realisation turned a family kitchen into a brand.","words":[[59.992,60.568],[60.588,60.648],[60.728,61.288],[61.328,61.448],[61.492,61.848],[61.901,62.328],[62.36,62.488],[62.52,62.648],[62.708,63.128],[63.208,63.288],[63.336,63.528],[63.597,64.008],[64.068,65.128],[65.219,65.768],[65.825,66.168],[66.248,66.648],[66.682,66.888],[66.96,67.848],[67.898,68.248],[68.317,68.728],[68.76,68.888],[68.915,69.048],[69.115,69.688],[69.912,70.808],[70.856,71.528],[71.574,71.848],[71.888,71.928],[71.985,72.328],[72.378,72.728],[72.808,73.128],[73.168,73.208],[73.288,73.768]]},{"key":"story#explain","text":"Here's the idea: Every brand starts with a problem. Eat Better began with a family that wanted snacks that were tasty and healthy at the same time.","words":[[75,75.208],[75.248,75.368],[75.464,76.488],[76.528,76.728],[76.808,77.208],[77.254,77.528],[77.56,77.688],[77.808,77.928],[77.958,78.248],[78.528,79.368],[79.414,79.688],[79.741,80.008],[80.04,80.168],[80.248,80.328],[80.385,80.728],[80.76,80.888],[80.934,81.208],[81.288,81.768],[81.8,81.928],[81.96,82.088],[82.181,82.648],[82.748,83.048],[83.108,83.528],[83.581,83.688],[83.708,83.768],[83.832,84.088],[84.168,84.488]]},{"key":"exhibitions#0","text":"Before the internet: a stall","words":[[85.654,85.928],[85.968,86.088],[86.141,86.808],[86.928,87.048],[87.128,87.528]]},{"key":"exhibitions#1","text":"The founders sold at exhibitions and directly to customers.","words":[[88.328,88.808],[88.861,89.288],[89.352,89.608],[89.635,89.688],[89.761,90.568],[90.588,90.648],[90.701,91.128],[91.155,91.208],[91.272,92.088]]},{"key":"exhibitions#2","text":"Meeting customers face to face gave honest, immediate feedback on taste, price and packaging.","words":[[92.418,93.048],[93.104,93.608],[93.656,93.848],[93.928,94.088],[94.152,94.408],[94.456,94.648],[94.728,95.368],[95.432,96.008],[96.07,96.568],[96.648,96.808],[96.888,97.688],[97.755,98.088],[98.168,98.408],[98.464,99.128]]},{"key":"exhibitions#3","text":"This built a loyal community from the ground up, before the brand went online.","words":[[99.48,100.248],[100.288,100.488],[100.608,100.728],[100.781,101.048],[101.104,101.608],[101.64,101.768],[101.788,101.848],[101.894,102.168],[102.248,102.728],[102.774,103.048],[103.088,103.208],[103.261,103.528],[103.576,103.768],[103.848,104.701]]},{"key":"exhibitions#explain","text":"In simple words: Before selling online, the founders sold at exhibitions and through direct selling. At a stall, they could talk to customers, let them taste the snacks, and learn what they liked.","words":[[105.515,105.528],[105.585,105.928],[106.008,106.488],[106.591,107.208],[107.258,107.608],[107.688,108.488],[108.528,108.648],[108.701,109.128],[109.176,109.368],[109.421,109.528],[109.595,110.328],[110.408,110.648],[110.678,110.888],[110.945,111.288],[111.338,111.768],[112.088,112.728],[112.768,112.808],[112.888,113.528],[113.544,113.608],[113.648,113.848],[113.896,114.088],[114.115,114.168],[114.224,115.128],[115.168,115.288],[115.336,115.528],[115.581,115.848],[115.888,116.008],[116.088,116.888],[116.928,117.048],[117.101,117.368],[117.4,117.528],[117.56,117.688],[117.741,118.088]]},{"key":"stall-day#0","text":"Run the Eat Better stall","words":[[119.403,119.448],[119.488,119.608],[119.688,119.928],[119.962,120.168],[120.248,120.648]]},{"key":"stall-day#1","text":"It's exhibition day and you are the seller. Five customers will walk up with questions. Read the pack, give the answer that makes each one happy — and win the day.","words":[[121.501,122.008],[122.066,122.648],[122.728,122.968],[123.068,123.368],[123.448,123.688],[123.728,123.848],[123.868,123.928],[123.985,124.648],[124.84,125.608],[125.664,126.168],[126.216,126.408],[126.456,126.648],[126.701,126.808],[126.84,126.968],[127.024,127.848],[127.96,128.408],[128.428,128.488],[128.568,129.288],[129.32,129.448],[129.488,129.608],[129.654,129.928],[129.96,130.088],[130.141,130.408],[130.472,130.728],[130.788,130.968],[131.035,131.368],[131.528,131.688],[131.728,131.848],[131.928,132.168],[132.208,132.328],[132.408,132.728]]},{"key":"stall-day#2","text":"Stall Day","words":[[133.827,134.094],[134.174,134.414]]},{"key":"stall-day#3","text":"The exhibition is open. Five customers are heading to your Eat Better stall.","words":[[135.164,135.614],[135.658,136.094],[136.147,136.254],[136.334,137.134],[137.23,137.614],[137.662,138.094],[138.134,138.254],[138.284,138.494],[138.547,138.654],[138.686,138.814],[138.894,139.134],[139.168,139.374],[139.441,139.854]]},{"key":"stall-day#4","text":"1 A customer walks up to your stall with a question.","words":[[141.15,141.214],[141.574,141.934],[141.987,142.414],[142.467,142.734],[142.787,142.894],[142.921,142.974],[143.006,143.134],[143.187,143.454],[143.486,143.614],[143.654,143.694],[143.747,144.254]]},{"key":"stall-day#5","text":"2 Read the pack they ask about, then pick the answer that would make them happy.","words":[[145.534,145.614],[145.758,146.334],[146.354,146.414],[146.478,146.734],[146.766,146.894],[146.954,147.134],[147.187,147.774],[147.822,148.014],[148.062,148.254],[148.294,148.414],[148.46,148.734],[148.766,148.894],[148.921,149.054],[149.086,149.214],[149.246,149.374],[149.454,150.307]]},{"key":"stall-day#6","text":"3 First try earns 3 stars, second try 2, third try 1.","words":[[151.514,151.614],[151.761,152.494],[152.594,152.894],[152.961,153.294],[153.374,153.534],[153.614,154.334],[154.391,154.734],[154.814,155.054],[155.134,155.814],[155.874,156.174],[156.274,156.574],[156.894,157.294]]},{"key":"stall-day#7","text":"4 Make all 5 customers happy to win the day.","words":[[158.581,158.9],[159.044,159.62],[159.7,159.94],[160.1,160.34],[160.388,160.82],[160.887,161.22],[161.273,161.38],[161.44,161.62],[161.64,161.7],[161.78,162.1]]},{"key":"stall-day#8","text":"The customers are practice scenarios. The packs and product facts are Eat Better's own.","words":[[162.9,163.38],[163.428,163.86],[163.9,164.02],[164.073,164.5],[164.572,165.54],[165.62,165.86],[165.927,166.26],[166.3,166.42],[166.47,166.82],[166.873,167.14],[167.2,167.38],[167.44,167.62],[167.666,168.02],[168.1,168.42]]},{"key":"national#0","text":"From one city to all of India","words":[[169.828,169.86],[169.94,170.18],[170.244,170.5],[170.607,170.82],[170.9,171.14],[171.193,171.3],[171.367,171.7]]},{"key":"national#1","text":"Diwali Corporate Gifting, Done Thoughtfully | Inside Eat Better Co","words":[[172.287,172.82],[172.868,173.3],[173.38,174.02],[174.068,174.26],[174.3,174.9],[175.14,175.38],[175.449,175.86],[175.94,176.18],[176.214,176.42],[176.527,176.74]]},{"key":"national#2","text":"The kitchen that started with dates, millets and masalas now packs festive gifts at scale. As you watch, spot how many people it now takes to do what the founders once did by themselves.","words":[[177.32,178.1],[178.15,178.5],[178.532,178.66],[178.71,179.06],[179.092,179.22],[179.3,179.94],[179.98,180.34],[180.38,180.5],[180.56,181.14],[181.3,181.78],[181.847,182.18],[182.24,182.66],[182.727,183.06],[183.14,183.3],[183.367,183.78],[184.127,184.82],[184.86,184.98],[185.047,185.62],[185.684,185.94],[186,186.18],[186.212,186.34],[186.386,186.66],[186.713,186.82],[186.86,186.98],[187.06,187.46],[187.487,187.54],[187.593,187.7],[187.732,187.86],[187.88,187.94],[188.002,188.5],[188.564,188.82],[188.86,188.98],[189.033,189.14],[189.213,189.967]]},{"key":"national#explain","text":"Think of it like this: Step by step, the brand grew from one city to customers across India.","words":[[191.007,191.14],[191.167,191.22],[191.273,191.38],[191.428,191.62],[191.684,192.02],[192.18,192.82],[192.873,192.98],[193.076,193.7],[193.74,193.86],[193.913,194.18],[194.244,194.5],[194.548,194.74],[194.82,195.06],[195.14,195.46],[195.593,195.86],[195.916,196.42],[196.489,196.9],[196.98,197.807]]},{"key":"leaders#0","text":"The leadership team","words":[[198.725,198.74],[198.791,199.3],[199.364,199.62]]},{"key":"leaders#1","text":"Started the kitchen and shaped the product philosophy","words":[[200.34,200.9],[200.92,200.98],[201.03,201.38],[201.44,201.62],[201.689,202.1],[202.12,202.18],[202.23,202.58],[202.638,203.22]]},{"key":"leaders#2","text":"Leads the company’s overall direction and growth","words":[[203.993,204.66],[204.68,204.74],[204.8,205.3],[205.36,205.78],[205.836,206.34],[206.38,206.5],[206.58,207.06]]},{"key":"leaders#3","text":"Leads brand and marketing","words":[[207.767,208.5],[208.58,208.98],[209.02,209.14],[209.196,209.7]]},{"key":"leaders#4","text":"Chief Growth Officer (as listed in business databases)","words":[[210.393,211.06],[211.106,211.38],[211.45,211.94],[212.14,212.42],[212.477,212.82],[212.873,212.98],[213.016,213.3],[213.372,214.099]]},{"key":"leaders#5","text":"Focuses on growth","words":[[214.164,214.58],[214.66,214.82],[214.9,215.38]]},{"key":"leaders#6","text":"Note: the role descriptions are general explanations of what such roles usually do, not statements from the brand.","words":[[216.292,217.1],[217.15,217.3],[217.364,217.62],[217.663,218.18],[218.24,218.42],[218.48,218.9],[218.968,219.78],[219.833,219.94],[219.988,220.18],[220.244,220.5],[220.553,220.82],[220.88,221.3],[221.407,221.7],[221.86,222.34],[222.384,222.82],[222.852,222.98],[223,223.06],[223.14,223.619]]},{"key":"leaders#7","text":"Eat Better Co Founders & Leadership Team | Shark Tank India S4","words":[[223.895,223.94],[223.974,224.18],[224.287,224.5],[224.553,224.98],[225.1,225.22],[225.264,225.7],[225.78,226.1],[226.3,226.5],[226.54,226.74],[226.804,227.06],[227.127,227.46],[227.86,228.58]]},{"key":"leaders#explain","text":"So what does that mean? The three founders are Mridula Kanoria, Shaurya Kanoria and Vidushi Kajaria.","words":[[229.753,229.86],[229.892,230.02],[230.068,230.26],[230.292,230.42],[230.5,231.34],[231.47,231.86],[231.9,232.1],[232.153,232.58],[232.64,232.82],[232.86,233.3],[233.34,234.14],[234.21,234.82],[234.86,235.3],[235.42,235.78],[235.84,236.26],[236.3,236.98]]},{"key":"roles#0","text":"Doing everything → doing one thing well","words":[[238.222,238.422],[238.473,238.982],[239.302,239.622],[239.675,239.942],[240.002,240.182],[240.249,240.582],[240.662,240.982]]},{"key":"roles#1","text":"Switch between the two stages and watch the work reorganise.","words":[[241.668,242.182],[242.232,242.582],[242.602,242.662],[242.722,242.902],[242.982,243.462],[243.522,243.702],[243.755,244.022],[244.062,244.182],[244.246,244.502],[244.582,245.382]]},{"key":"roles#2","text":"The founders did everything themselves:","words":[[245.762,246.182],[246.235,246.662],[246.702,246.822],[246.873,247.382],[247.447,248.582]]},{"key":"roles#3","text":"Same few people, every job.","words":[[248.71,248.902],[248.942,249.062],[249.131,249.822],[249.869,250.102],[250.202,250.582]]},{"key":"roles#explain","text":"Let me explain: In the early days, the founders did everything themselves: making, selling and answering customers. As the company grew, each leader could focus on doing one thing really well.","words":[[251.912,251.942],[251.969,252.022],[252.092,252.662],[252.875,253.302],[253.322,253.382],[253.435,253.702],[253.766,254.342],[254.362,254.422],[254.475,254.902],[254.962,255.142],[255.186,255.622],[255.687,256.822],[256.879,257.622],[257.672,258.022],[258.082,258.262],[258.318,258.822],[258.878,259.462],[259.809,260.502],[260.542,260.662],[260.712,261.062],[261.142,261.862],[261.91,262.102],[262.148,262.422],[262.462,262.662],[262.715,262.982],[263.035,263.142],[263.195,263.462],[263.542,263.782],[263.849,264.182],[264.262,264.742],[264.822,265.143]]},{"key":"timeline#0","text":"Five moments that built the brand","words":[[266.566,266.822],[266.882,267.302],[267.35,267.542],[267.595,267.862],[267.882,267.942],[268.022,268.422]]},{"key":"timeline#1","text":"Tap each moment on the line.","words":[[269.172,269.622],[269.686,269.942],[269.999,270.342],[270.395,270.502],[270.522,270.582],[270.678,271.409]]},{"key":"timeline#explain","text":"Here's the idea: Here is the lesson. The founders did not start with a big factory. They started with a real family problem, tested recipes with real customers, and scaled step by step.","words":[[272.241,272.342],[272.362,272.422],[272.518,273.182],[273.238,273.462],[273.542,273.702],[273.722,273.782],[273.851,274.263],[274.442,274.982],[275.035,275.462],[275.502,275.622],[275.682,275.862],[275.915,276.182],[276.214,276.342],[276.382,276.422],[276.482,276.662],[276.732,277.662],[277.75,278.102],[278.152,278.502],[278.534,278.662],[278.702,278.742],[278.822,279.142],[279.199,279.542],[279.612,280.502],[280.559,280.902],[280.972,281.462],[281.494,281.622],[281.67,281.862],[281.926,282.902],[282.922,282.982],[283.062,283.542],[283.638,284.022],[284.102,284.262],[284.326,284.662]]},{"key":"think#0","text":"Think like a founder","words":[[285.969,286.102],[286.15,286.342],[286.382,286.422],[286.472,286.822]]},{"key":"think#1","text":"What is the advantage of selling at exhibitions before selling online?","words":[[287.75,287.782],[287.835,287.942],[287.962,288.022],[288.078,288.582],[288.609,288.662],[288.712,289.062],[289.115,289.222],[289.289,290.022],[290.068,290.342],[290.392,290.742],[290.822,291.675]]},{"key":"outro","text":"And that's the whole chapter! You listened all the way through. Great job!","words":[[292.552,292.582],[292.63,292.902],[292.922,292.982],[293.022,293.222],[293.292,294.142],[294.232,294.502],[294.555,294.982],[295.042,295.222],[295.262,295.382],[295.422,295.542],[295.602,296.342],[296.395,296.662],[296.762,297.222]]}]}]}